# Upstream checkouts, cloned rather than vendored: 223 MB of embedded git
# repositories that `git add -A` in this directory otherwise sweeps into the
# index as gitlinks. That has happened twice, and both times the commit had to
# be amended, so it is stated here rather than remembered.
#
# These are *checkouts* with their own .git, unlike the other methods' upstream
# trees (`vega/`, `rerf/upstream/`) which are vendored copies and are tracked.
upstream/3dgstream/
upstream/queen/
